#. この付近にいるはずですわ。
#. 手分けして追い詰めましょう。
msgctxt "0001 | CELES"
msgid ""
"He must be around here somewhere. Let's split up and\n"
"corner him!"
msgstr ""

#. だが、無理はするなよ。
#. 何か見つけたら、すぐに叫んで我を呼べ。
msgctxt "0002 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"But don't take any chances. As soon as you find him,\n"
"call out and I'll come running."
msgstr ""

#. …ですが、なんて叫べばよろしいのですか？
msgctxt "0003 | CELES"
msgid "Okay, but...what should we yell?"
msgstr ""

#. なんでもいいよ、そんなの！
msgctxt "0004 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Anything! It doesn't matter!"
msgstr ""

#. では…“キャア”でよろしいですか？
msgctxt "0005 | CELES"
msgid "Then...is \"haaah!\" okay?"
msgstr ""

#. キャアでもドッヒャーでも、なんでもいいって！！
#. とにかく聞えるように叫べばいいから！
msgctxt "0006 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Haaah or dohyaah or whatever you want! Just yell loud\n"
"enough so we can hear you!"
msgstr ""

#. うふふ…ドッヒャーですって。
#. そんなリアクションは聞いた事がありませんわ…
msgctxt "0007 | CELES"
msgid "Hmhmhm. Dohyaah? I have never heard such a reaction..."
msgstr ""

#. あー、もうっ！　いいから急いで捜してッ！！
#. じゃあ、行くよッ！！
msgctxt "0008 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Okay, whatever! Just hurry up and start looking! Okay?\n"
"Let's go!"
msgstr ""

#. ロボちゃーん！　どこに隠れたのー！！
#. 出て来ないと解体しちゃうわよーッ！！
msgctxt "0009 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Hey Mister Robot! Where ya hidin'? If you don't come\n"
"out, we're gonna decommission ya!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>どこかに潜んだ不審者を捜し、
#. ボクらは四方へと散開した…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>We spread out in every direction to track down the\n"
"costumed suspect.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ドッヒャァァァァァーーーーーーッ！！
msgctxt "0011 | NO NAME"
msgid "Ha-aaaaaahhhh!"
msgstr ""

#. 今の変な叫び声！！
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "That strange cry—!"
msgstr ""

#. 明らかに…セレスさんのだよな？
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "That had to be Celeste!"
msgstr ""

#. 上の階から…３階から聞こえたぞ！！
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"It came from the floor above... She's on the 3rd\n"
"floor!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクは、急いで３階へと駆け上がった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I sprinted up to the 3rd floor.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>不審者は、この付近にいるはず…
#. この階をくまなく調べよう。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>He's gotta be around here somewhere. I'd better check\n"
"the 3rd floor really well...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ここは女子トイレだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0017 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is the girls bathroom.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>緊急事態とはいえ、
#. 入る訳にはいかないよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0018 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Even though this is an emergency, I can't go in...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>不審者は、この付近にいるはず…
#. この階をくまなく調べよう。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>He's gotta be around here somewhere. I'd better check\n"
"the 3rd floor really well...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
